{"id":"770948d5c2bf7204","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-top4-completely-metrizable-space.md","title":"ZFC Top4 Completely Metrizable Space","display":"df-zfc-top4-completely-metrizable-space — ZFC Top4 Completely Metrizable Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top4-completely-metrizable-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top4-completely-metrizable-space"],"display":"df-zfc-top4-completely-metrizable-space — ZFC Top4 Completely Metrizable Space","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-top4-metrizable-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top4-completely-metrizable-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top4-completely-metrizable-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top4-completely-metrizable-space — ZFC Top4 Completely Metrizable Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2c2c52f227661657\" href=\"?note=2c2c52f227661657\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0d02dcc69684a5ea\" href=\"?note=0d02dcc69684a5ea\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-top4-metrizable-space\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-top4-metrizable-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S(X,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S(X,d)\\)</span> is the complete-metric-space predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2c2c52f227661657\" href=\"?note=2c2c52f227661657\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InducesTopology}_S(d,X,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{InducesTopology}_S(d,X,\\tau)\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0d02dcc69684a5ea\" href=\"?note=0d02dcc69684a5ea\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-top4-metrizable-space\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-top4-metrizable-space</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4CompletelyMetrizableSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop4CompletelyMetrizableSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}completely\\text{-}metrizable\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop4CompletelyMetrizableSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\exists d\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})^{X\\times X}\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S(X,d)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{InducesTopology}_S(d,X,\\tau)\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}completely\\text{-}metrizable\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop4CompletelyMetrizableSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\exists d\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})^{X\\times X}\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S(X,d)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{InducesTopology}_S(d,X,\\tau)\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A compatible metric must be complete and must induce the displayed topology; the parameter order agrees with both upstream predicates.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space","status":"resolved","id":"2c2c52f227661657","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-top4-metrizable-space","status":"resolved","id":"0d02dcc69684a5ea","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-top4-metrizable-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space","status":"resolved","id":"2c2c52f227661657","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S(X,d)$ is the complete-metric-space predicate from [[../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space]].","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-top4-metrizable-space","status":"resolved","id":"0d02dcc69684a5ea","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)$ and $\\operatorname{InducesTopology}_S(d,X,\\tau)$ are as in [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-top4-metrizable-space]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S(X,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{InducesTopology}_S(d,X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4CompletelyMetrizableSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}completely\\text{-}metrizable\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop4CompletelyMetrizableSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\exists d\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})^{X\\times X}\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S(X,d)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{InducesTopology}_S(d,X,\\tau)\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1440,"backlinks":[{"id":"169165d3860d677a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop4CompletelyMetrizableSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-top4-completely-metrizable-space.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3567","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-top4-completely-metrizable-space.md|58-df-zfc-top4-completely-metrizable-space]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","2c2c52f227661657","0d02dcc69684a5ea"]}